 "scene": {
  "desc": "A small, bright modern cafe in daytime. Soft white walls and ceiling, a warm cream-yellow floor, and three tall floor-to-ceiling windows with a brown wooden header along the left wall. An L-shaped dark brown wooden bar counter with a light cream base stripe sits in the middle, with a two-layer beige wooden shelf hanging from the ceiling above it and three black cylindrical pendant lights. Three white round-seat bar stools with chrome legs line the front of the bar. Two white round tables on chrome pedestals with dark brown wooden chairs stand by the windows, and a dark brown double door is set in the back wall to the right of the bar. Behind the bar, a low back counter holds a chrome two-group espresso machine and a coffee grinder. The street entrance is a wide glass door in the front wall.",
